<title>USA: DLJ affiliate, DecisionOne to merge.</title>
<headline>DLJ affiliate, DecisionOne to merge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Inc said Monday that an affiliate of DLJ Merchant Banking Partners II has signed a definitive merger agreement to buy over 85 percent of the common stock of DecisionOne Holdings Corp for $23 a share.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement, the holders of each share of common stock of DecisionOne could elect to receive $23 per share in cash or to retain such share of stock in the surviving entity.</p>
<p>The transaction is estimated to have a value of about $924 million, including refinancing of existing indebtedness.</p>
</text>
